388
00:44:58,159 --> 00:45:02,061
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Ang iba pong mga bayan ay marami pong isla.

389
00:45:02,061 --> 00:45:06,880
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, ang kanilang mga ambulansya ay hindi rin po makakatawid.

390
00:45:06,880 --> 00:45:12,640
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, it will be just inside the municipal island or the area nila.

391
00:45:12,640 --> 00:45:20,731
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, kasama rin po sa aming mandate for providing medical mobility,

392
00:45:20,731 --> 00:45:24,894
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: sa aming mandate namin to provide charities of national character,

393
00:45:24,894 --> 00:45:31,648
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: ang gawin pong effective yung pinamigay namin mga ambulanses or PTP na tinatawag.

394
00:45:31,648 --> 00:45:39,248
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And yun po ang nakita namin na very effective way to,

395
00:45:39,248 --> 00:45:42,262
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: hindi na po bababa kasi ang pasahir, ang pasyente.

396
00:45:42,262 --> 00:45:49,680
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Kung maalala nyo po, isinasakay pa po mula sa ambulansya, inililipat yan sa ambulance.

397
00:45:49,680 --> 00:45:53,302
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, kung maalan po yan, magkakaproblema pa pa pag binubuhat yan.

398
00:45:53,302 --> 00:45:59,068
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, ang aming intention is to have this door-to-door na po,

399
00:45:59,068 --> 00:46:08,038
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: yung ambulansya na po mismo, ang isasakay ito at dadali na po sa paglilipat ng hospital na mas equipped kung hindi po kaya.

400
00:46:08,038 --> 00:46:17,839
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: At meron po kami, ito naman po ay the LGUs will have to secure licenses from Marina once they receive this.

401
00:46:17,839 --> 00:46:24,240
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: At we are starting with around 10 muna.

402
00:46:24,240 --> 00:46:30,331
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And then, we will proceed from there for the next years naman po ang pagbigay namin.

403
00:46:30,331 --> 00:46:31,520
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Kasi hindi naman din po lahat.

404
00:46:31,520 --> 00:46:38,079
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And by the way, this will be for the provincial governments po dahil medyo iba po ang maintenance nito.

405
00:46:38,079 --> 00:46:48,960
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, we will be giving this to the provincial governments for them to schedule kung alin po yung mga bayan nila na mas nangangailangan ito.

406
00:46:48,960 --> 00:47:00,880
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And then, doon po sa aming procurement.

407
00:47:00,880 --> 00:47:08,560
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: [unclear] whoever wins the procurement will maintain it for the first three years.

408
00:47:08,560 --> 00:47:13,440
