430
00:49:08,478 --> 00:49:11,200
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Kung sino po ang mga kapaghingi po ng gano'n.

431
00:49:11,200 --> 00:49:13,040
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, it's a combination of this.

432
00:49:13,040 --> 00:49:16,640
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: If you need them, depende on the priority na kailangan.

433
00:49:16,640 --> 00:49:24,559
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And then the ability nila to train their personnel to handle such equipment.

